  "title": "Eastern Chad’s Maternal Health Crisis: Malnutrition Threatens Pregnant Women and Babies Amid Growing Humanitarian Challenges",
  "summary": "A growing humanitarian crisis in eastern Chad is putting the lives of pregnant and breastfeeding women and their babies at serious risk. Recent reports reveal that more than one in five pregnant and breastfeeding women screened in the border region of Adré are suffering from acute malnutrition, highlighting the devastating impact of conflict, displacement, poverty, and declining international aid. The situation has become increasingly severe since the outbreak of war in neighbouring Sudan force",
